# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Claude Code — the machine-specific leaves, not the directory. `settings.local.json`
# accumulates the absolute paths of whichever laptop approved a command and `worktrees/` is a
# scratch working copy; neither is shareable. Everything else under `.claude/` — `settings.json`,
# `skills/`, `agents/` — is meant to reach both volunteers, so it is committed and reviewed by
# pull request like the rest of the repository. A file in there that carries a laptop path is a
# bug in the file, not a reason to hide the directory.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Local dev run state — logs and pid files from ./dev
.dev/

# graphify's knowledge graph of this repository. Generated by `graphify extract .`, rebuilt
# by `graphify update .`, and describing whichever working tree it was built from — so it is
# a local artefact, not a shared one. Committing it would put a large generated JSON in the
# way of every merge.
graphify-out/
